{"user": "I\u2019m not sure where to begin.", "user_ts": "2026-08-04T13:54:20.330175+00:00", "assistant": "Start with **corners and White\u2019s next move**, not \u201chow many discs do I flip.\u201d\n\nAsk yourself for each legal move (**g2, b6, a7, b7, b8, c8**):\n\n1. Does this let White take a corner like **h1** or **a8** next?\n2. Does it leave White with very few legal moves, maybe forcing a pass?\n3. If White gets a corner, can Black still win the final count?\n\nA good first comparison: look at the moves near the empty **a8 corner** (**a7, b7, b8, c8**) and ask which ones *actually* hand White that corner.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-04T13:54:29.766627+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-04T13:54:31.898149+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Metacomment"], "consensus": ["Metacomment"], "votes": {"Metacomment": 3, "Think Aloud": 1}, "confidence": {"Metacomment": 1.0, "Think Aloud": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"llama": ["Metacomment"], "gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Metacomment"], "sonnet": ["Metacomment"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt", "Pose Simplified Problem"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt", "Pose Simplified Problem"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 2, "Hint": 3, "Prompt": 2, "Pose Simplified Problem": 2}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 0.6666666666666666, "Hint": 1.0, "Prompt": 0.6666666666666666, "Pose Simplified Problem": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt", "Pose Simplified Problem"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"], "sonnet": ["Hint", "Pose Simplified Problem"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Hint", "Prompt"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Hint"